5,1,1,talk,Servas,,We must look at the past. What happened to the last three rollouts?,"{""words"":13,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
6,1,1,talk,Daisuke,,I worry about the budget. Let us check the capital budget and software allowance.,"{""words"":14,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
