8,1,1,talk,Ryuji,,I need to see the time lost to copying existing records.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
9,1,1,talk,Asuka,,I am concerned about staffing. Let us look at the staffing of the coordination group.,"{""words"":15,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
