17,1,3,talk,Sakura,,I will check in-house developer availability. I need to know who builds.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
18,1,3,talk,Ryuji,,I will also look at misrouted deliveries in the incident logs.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
19,1,3,talk,Asuka,,I will check handling of vendor queries. It seems repetitive.,"{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
