35,2,1,talk,Servas,,The last three rollouts show a pattern. Daily entry tools were dropped.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Daisuke,,"The capital line is frozen, but software allowance has room.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Sakura,,Half the customer plants have no signal. That is a big risk.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,We lose an hour daily copying records. That is significant waste.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Asuka,,The coordination group is understaffed. Two people do all the work.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Servas,,"@Ryuji, if we stop copying, we save time. But will they use it?","{""words"":13,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Daisuke,,"@Sakura, if the network is bad, a mobile app might fail.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Sakura""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Sakura,,"@Daisuke, but the developers are busy until Q3. We can't build now.","{""words"":12,""mentions"":[""Daisuke""],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"@Asuka, if the staff is stretched, adding more work is dangerous.","{""words"":11,""mentions"":[""Asuka""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Asuka,,"@Servas, the standardization efforts failed because no one owned them.","{""words"":10,""mentions"":[""Servas""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Servas,,We need a tool that is simple and owned by one group.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Daisuke,,The fixed-fee work is cheaper than per-head licences.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Sakura,,The vendor queries are repetitive. We ask for the same certificate again.,"{""words"":12,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,The misrouted deliveries are due to duplicate addresses.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Asuka,,A central repository could fix the address issue.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Servas,,I think we should focus on data consistency.,"{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Daisuke,,I agree. It fits the software allowance.,"{""words"":7,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Sakura,,But who will maintain it? The developers are busy.,"{""words"":9,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"If it reduces copying, it is worth it.","{""words"":8,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Asuka,,It must be simple enough for the current staff to handle.,"{""words"":11,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
